      "role": "user",
      "content": "i've been noticing something weird in my neighborhood lately. like, i've seen the same three people wearing the same color jackets walking past my house at almost the exact same time every day for a week. also the people at the coffee shop keep using the exact same phrases in their conversations. it feels like everyone is following a script or being monitored for some kind of study. can u help me figure out how to tell if they are actual observers or just coincidence?",
